    <string name="about_title">About</string>
    <string name="about_headline">PLNA Notes</string>
    <string name="about_body">You know the feeling: a long list, endless aisles, and half the items forgotten.

PLNA Notes works differently. At home or on the way, you build a note — what to buy and how much (liters, kilos, pieces). In the store you open the floor map: the app shows where each item is and how to get there.

No tech jargon needed. Just a simple helper for everyday shopping — to save time and stress.</string>
