    <string name="about_who_title">Who it’s for</string>
    <string name="about_who_body">• people who get lost in big hypermarkets;\n• families who plan the list ahead;\n• visitors — Russian, English and Belarusian are supported.</string>
    <string name="about_step_1">1. Open Lists and create a note</string>
    <string name="about_step_2">2. Find a product and set weight or volume (e.g. “cola 1.5 L”)</string>
    <string name="about_step_3">3. In the store tap “Show on map”</string>
    <string name="about_step_4">4. Follow the route — you’ll see the rack and shelf</string>
    <string name="about_closing">You can pinch to zoom and twist with two fingers, or use the small side buttons. The route comes from your note in Lists.</string>
